window.products.push({"id":987068,"name":"Adhesive Hat Hooks for Wall, 8 Pack, Baoswi, Hat Organizer Wall Mounted Minimalist Hat Holder Clothes Hooks Hat Storage Hat Rack for Wall (Rose Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wc2c1a45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specification: Overall Dimensions: 1.77*1.2*1 inch (L*W*H) Material: Glitter acrylic Color: Rose Gold Easy to use: Stick it on the desired position. You do not have to drill holes into the walls. NOTE: Paint wall is not available it might damage your paint!!! 1. Wipe the wall and make sure it is dry and clean; 2. Peel off the protective film of the adhesive tape, attach to the back of the hat hook; 3. Attach the hook on the smooth surface and press it tightly for 10 seconds; 4. Please wait 24 hours before hanging to ensure it firmly fixed. Features: POWERFUL and STURDY - Strong self adhesive and sturdy material provide extra strength and durability for long-term use. Our adhesive hook can hold strongly on most of smooth surface, like ceramic tile, metal surface, glasses, etc. Each small hat rack can hold up to 3 lbs.  CUTE and MINIMALIST - Nice sparkle and bright colors, glitter acrylic makes an elegant art work. As well as the hooks will be almost hidden from view when hanging hats. You can create a unique and stylish hat display of your own.  WIDELY APPLICATION – This hanging hook can be widely applied in closet, bathroom, bedroom, living room, storage room, garage and office, etc. Our self-adhesive wall hooks can be used for hat hangers, hat organizer for baseball caps; can be used for necklace holders, jewelry organizers, hairband or headband; can be used for headphone hangers, phone holders; or for other home organization to hang something light weight like towers, scarves, purses, handbags, shopping bags, wires, strings and more!  PRACTICAL and DECORATIVE: this decorative wall hook is not only a practical hook for hanging hats organized and saving space, but also a unique adornment for adding elegant and bright colors. Package Included: 8 Pieces Self Adhesive Hat Hooks (Rose Gold)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wc2c1a45L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baoswi","source_asin":"B09PND28JG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PND28JG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PND28JG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
