window.products.push({"id":987109,"name":"Amanti Art Wall Wood Framed Mirror, Glass Size 40x30, Veneto Distressed Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i5qHCiIXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"60% Beveled Glass, 40% Wood DIMENSIONS: The overall size of this wall mirror measures 44.62 x 34.62 inches, including the frame. Its reflective area measures 40.00 x 30.00 inches and has a 1-inch bevel. The mirror works perfectly as a bedroom, office, entryway, or bathroom mirror. 100% REAL WOOD FRAME: You can't mistake the quality of real wood mirrors for your wall decor. The Veneto Distressed Black 2 1/2\" Wood frame is a distressed, black frame with gold undertones and an embossed gold inner lip. The frame measures 2.62 x 1.061 inches. HASSLE-FREE HANGING: We make it easy for you to hang this wall mounted mirror by giving you everything you need. All mirror sizes have durable hanging wires attached to the back to hang vertically or horizontally, along with a hanging hook and nail. Tap the nail into your selected space and hang it on our included specialty hook. It really does hold with just one of them. HANDMADE IN THE USA: Amanti Art hand makes all our decorative mirrors in Madison, WI. Every member of our team is trained to handle and inspect each aspect of the custom framing journey. We hand-carry your piece from one finishing station to the next, then carefully pack it to ensure it reaches you in the finest condition. Because our focus is on workmanship, our products are used by architects, developers, designers and homeowners alike to create beautiful living spaces. GREAT WAYS TO USE A WALL MIRROR: Mirrors are an affordable way to decorate your wall while bringing light and space into a room. Adding a x-large mirror can make your space appear larger and more inviting, especially if its a well-placed foyer or living room mirror. Hang it at eye level or position it so it reflects other home decor elements in the room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i5qHCiIXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amanti Art","source_asin":"B072BJGG4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072BJGG4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072BJGG4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
