window.products.push({"id":987407,"name":"Reusable Grocery Shopping Bags Foldable Totes,2 Pack Lightweight Washable Durable Reusable Bags Fast Dry Tote Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81evmIy-bKL._AC_UL1200_.jpg","description":"Polyester Sturdy and durable👜👜This shopping grocery bag is sturdy and durable, made of tear-resistant polyester fiber, with delicate and fine stitches, which is more durable. Moreover, the long and wide handle of this shopping tote bag is connected to the body of the bag instead of being attached to it. Therefore, to prevent the possibility of breakage, not only can you carry it on your shoulder, but also help reduce weight. Reusable and environmentally friendly 👜👜 Advanced color printing technology will not fade after being washed again and again, and can be dried quickly after washing, can be reused, reducing the number of disposable shopping bags, reducing carbon footprint and plastic consumption, protecting beauty Earth. Large capacity can hold more groceries 👜👜This bag is 17.9 inches long and 16 inches high. The handle is 9.8 inches long. It has a larger capacity than ordinary plastic grocery bags and can hold more items. You can get all your items with one bag when you go out. Soft and easy to fold for easy storage👜👜 The fabric is very soft and lightweight, can be easily folded into the small pocket of the included pocket size, and is small enough to be placed in the pocket or wallet at will , Easy to use can be used for daily shopping, travel, laundry, storage, etc. Cute patterns 👜👜 Shopping bags are rich in variety of colors. A variety of colorful patterns can make people feel happy. They are very suitable for grocery shopping, seaside vacations or travel souvenirs, and can also be used as practical gifts for family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81evmIy-bKL._AC_UL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloele","source_asin":"B087P988Q8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087P988Q8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087P988Q8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":987408,"name":"Sinceda Modern Non Ticking Silent Quartz Analog Digital Wall Clock (Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n84F1bTkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The clock's simplicity in design offers quick and easy installation. All you have to do is insert a single AA battery (not included), and the back slot makes it easy to hang. Another great thing about this clock is that it's even easier to maintain. It's super easy to clean because the clock is cased with a flat lens that covers and protects the face from dust and debris. The clock is silent so you don't need to worry about the constant ticking of regular clocks when you need some peace and quiet to concentrate on your work or enjoy a full night of undisturbed sleep. Add a retro touch to your room with a clock that's both practical and stylish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n84F1bTkL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sinceda","source_asin":"B00IR24752","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IR24752","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IR24752","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
