window.products.push({"id":987436,"name":"3-Component Animal & Bird Deterrent System – 16.92 Ft. x 1.4 In. Clear-White Bird Spikes with Bells & 22 Yd. Orange Wire – Protect Your Property with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+GxOD0mUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Line They Won’t CrossYou’ve tried gallons of gooey gel and a whole parliament of plastic owls to keep birds away. The squirrels and raccoons taunt you, and the stray cats are frustratingly adaptable. Show all these critters and more that you rule this land with a 3-pronged and many-spiked approach from GUARD LINE.The Bird’s Eye ViewGet inside the minds of your unwanted guests to scare birds away effectively. It takes more than a simple spike strip to deter intelligent pigeons and crows. Your extra-tall bird spike strips are uncomfortable to perch on, and your bells annoy them. Block them from building nests with your blaze-orange wires, which also overwhelm the birds’ eyes with a distressing, unnatural color.Effective and CompassionateScare birds and squirrels without hurting them or their offspring. Your wildlife deterrent system works by gently heightening physical and psychological discomfort. Discourage your pests with a carefully designed combination of sensory cues that are more effective than a plastic owl or bird gel alone.Flexible InstallationsCustomize your fortifications by selecting brown or transparent spike strips to match the color of your structure. Your plastic deterrent spikes can be cut to size with a variety of tools. Nail or screw them down—they’re flexible enough that they’ll lay flush even on slightly uneven surfaces. Position your posts and tie on your orange wire. Add bells to the wire, and you’re done.GUARD LINE Gets ItLet’s be honest. You don’t dislike the birds; you just dislike their poop. And it goes without saying that you also dislike spending money on things that don’t work. Leave harmful, inhumane methods in the past, and breeze past ineffective decoys and temporary gels. And tell Bob he’ll need to do his birdwatching somewhere else now!Install your GUARD LINE bird spike system to keep animals “over there” while you sit on your beautifully clean porch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+GxOD0mUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUARD LINE","source_asin":"B08ZDGH8YG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZDGH8YG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZDGH8YG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
