window.products.push({"id":987495,"name":"Azauvc Knife Block With Strong Magnets,360 Magnetic Knife Holder without Knives,Display Stand and Storage Rack without Knives","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710V-47X3TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All Sided Strong Magnetic Suction Knife: With super strength hidden magnet.Double-sided suction knife design, super large capacity. The magnet is hidden in the middle of the wood, with strong adsorption.This magnetic knife block can suck all kinds of metal knives and other kitchen utensils. You can reach the knife easier, quicker and safer. Suitable For Common Household kitchen Cutters（Fruit knife, Kitchen Knife, Bread knife). Note: NOT for CERAMIC KNIVES. Rotatable Design: built-in rotatable base, easily and smoothly turn to your knife holder and take out the knives you want. Made of all solid wood, very strong and stable, no need to worry about the knife holder easily fall over. Super Large Capacity: Hold up to 8-12 knives(length from 3\" to 9\") at both sides of the knife holder, great space saver for your kitchen counter.This is a multi-functional use magnetic storage block. Not Only For Knives:It is not only suitable for storing knives, but also any metal accessories such as screws, screwdriver tools and other metal objects can be absorbed and stored with this magnetic knife holder. Elegant Display: Why fuss with a boringly average knife holder when you can display one of these beautiful knives? Made of wood naturally growing in nature, with warm texture and fine texture,with finely polished by hand.Fashionable, simple and practical. Safty Non-Slip Base: Finished with anti-skid felt pads on the bottom, our bamboo knife block is safer to use on slippery counter tops than ordinary blocks. No more skidding, slipping, sliding or wobbling around! Not Only For Knives:It is not only suitable for storing knives, but also any metal accessories such as screws, screwdriver tools and other metal objects can be absorbed and stored with this magnetic knife holder. Creating Your Green&Healthy Kitchen: Though it displays nicely on a countertop, the wooden knife holder is reliably strong.The surface is treated with natural vegetable oil, which make the surface delicate and easy to clean. It can be wiped with a rag.100% sustainable & safe for use in the kitchen. LIFETIME 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE. We’re confident with the quality and function. If you’re not happy with it, please tell us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710V-47X3TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Azauvc","source_asin":"B0BJ6LW782","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ6LW782","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ6LW782","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
