window.products.push({"id":987566,"name":"Smiley Face Coffee Mug. 14-18 Ounce Microwave Dishwasher Safe Stoneware Pottery. Beer Soup Coffee Tea Cups and Mugs. Black.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+KCxWuVKL._SL1150_.jpg","description":"Trip's not exactly what one would term a socializer. Except for the fact that he really prefers to pick out his fresh produce in person, Trip would likely order all of his groceries online just to avoid a crowd. If he must go to a department store, he makes sure to arrive well before it opens so that he can be the first person in line, and he wears a baseball cap to avoid eye contact and chews a big wad of bubble gum evade any unwanted conversations. The only event for which Trip tolerates a crowd is the annual sci-fi convention that he attends, but he's always in costume, and that's a totally different experience. Obviously, Trip's more of a one-on-one sorta' guy, which is probably why he enjoys serving beverages so much. Since Trip is, after all, a mug, he's inherently good at the job, and he's made from cone 10 stoneware, so he's very durable. Trip is even safe to use in the microwave and dishwasher. Trip is ready to ship and is carefully packaged in a gift box and shipped in a larger, sturdy shipping box. Our packaging materials include packing paper and plenty of bubble wrap. His personality description is included in his packaging. *****PLEASE NOTE: DUE TO THE UNIQUE NATURE OF OUR PRODUCT, MUGS WILL DIFFER IN FINISHED APPEARANCE AND GLAZE COLOR.***** Ug Chug Smiley Face Mugs are MICROWAVE and DISHWASHER safe. Ug Chug Smiley Face Mugs are ready to ship and are carefully packaged in a gift box, along with care instructions, and shipped in a sturdy shipping box. Our packaging materials include packing paper and plenty of bubble wrap. PERSONALITY DESCRIPTION IS INCLUDED.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+KCxWuVKL._SL1150_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nelson Studio Pottery","source_asin":"B07FK1R9RH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FK1R9RH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FK1R9RH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":987567,"name":"2 Pcs Vintage Coffee Mugs, Overnight Oats Containers with Lids and Spoons, 14oz Glass Clear Tea Cups, Drinking Glasses, Iced Coffee Cups, Cute Coffee ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819ezTZzXVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What You Get: 2 mugs of sun flower pattern, 2 mugs of raindrops pattern, 4 100%-nature-bamboo lids and 4 rose-gold spoons. Fine craftsmanship endows the cup with noble texture and beautiful appearance, Even if nothing is put, it still attracts attention. Whether it is used by yourself or given to relatives and friends, this glass cups with lids can bring high-quality coffee experience and pleasant visual enjoyment. Vintage and Elegant Design: The classic glass cup shape complements the relief carving of the cup body, and pairs perfectly with the bamboo lid and gold spoons. Intricate raindrop shapes and delicate sunflower patterns that adorn its surface, the raindrops cascade down the sides. This vintage coffee mug has a unique classic atmosphere and elegant design, whether it is at home or in a coffee bar, it can create a simple and elegant atmosphere for you. Multi-Use: Not only for coffee, this glass coffee mug also as a tea cup. Each glass is 14oz, enough to hold overnight oats, cappuccino, latte, yogurt, ice cream, milk and desserts. Not only suitable for home use, but also suitable as a coffee bar accessory. Coordinates perfectly with other vintage glassware and decorations, whether placed in a display case or hung on a wall as a decorative shelf, these coffee cups will catch everyone's eye and add a unique touch. Warm Gift: These handmade irish coffee glasses is exquisite yet functional, if you are looking for a unique and tasteful gift, the vintage coffee mug is definitely the ideal choice. It can be a perfect gift for Father's Day, Christmas, Birthday, Thanksgiving, Anniversary and more. Whether gifted in a gift basket or as an individual gift, coffee mugs with lids convey your warmth and care for them. Reusable: These glass cups with lids are made of high-quality materials, stackable, durable and microwave safe, 100% Lead-free and BPA -free. You can use them over and over again, reducing the use of disposable cups and being more environmentally friendly. Comes with a cute spoon and a bamboo lid that can be used as a coaster, which is very convenient. Tips on Using: The coffee mug is microwave safe, but it is not safe for the dishwasher, because the high-temperature water flow in the dishwasher and the impact of detergent may cause the surface of the cup to be worn. It is recommended to wash by hand, it may be troublesome, but it is worth it to protect the appearance and quality of the coffee cups, they will always accompany you to enjoy the delicious coffee time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819ezTZzXVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAPTIME","source_asin":"B0C4X369Y2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4X369Y2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4X369Y2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
