window.products.push({"id":987574,"name":"HBlife 6 Pack Clear Shelf Dividers, Vertical Purse Organizer for Closet Perfect for Sweater, Shirts, Handbags in Bedroom and Kitchen, Adjustable Acryl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bXfJpmhXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP YOUR CLOSET ORGANIZED: Great way to separate clothes or purses, our shelf dividers can keep them in place. Definitely, it can free up more space to make your house look better. The fly in the ointment is that please don't mount it on a board longer than 0.95 inches, it will cause it to break. A CLEVER DESGIN: How wonderful these simple dividers,you can customize how big you want each “cubby” to be. Unlike metal wire closet shelf divider, designed with round and smooth corners, it will not scrape your shelves or clothes. EASY TO USE: Just slide them on the closet shelf and you are done, there are no tools assembly required. With a smart design and smooth surface of acrylic, they can easily be removed and readjusted whenever needed. EASY TO FIND ANYTHING NEEDED: Whether you have met the following cases- it was really hard to find anything that you needed quick while getting ready for work in the mornings, furthermore, too many clothes to find your sweaters, T-shirts, handbags and towels. Now, everything looks visible and easy to find, by our crystal-clear acrylic. PERFECT FOR VARIOUS SCENARIOS: As insertions for shelves, it can be used for closet organization, and can help plan the space in bookshelf and pantry. Because its the position of the adjustment are more flexible, they can even be used to organize photos and certificates.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bXfJpmhXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HBlife","source_asin":"B0B9XMKKTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9XMKKTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9XMKKTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":987575,"name":"Kyvno 12\" Gel-Cooling Premium Memory Foam Mattress Adjustable Bed Frame Combo, Wireless Remote, Zero Gravity, TV/PC Position, Medium Firm, CertiPUR-US","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":999.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712i9SbP0OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADJUSTABLE BASE: (1) Full Base - “Whisper-Quiet”, Fully Adjustable, Upholstered Full bed base adjusts to your needs with the touch of a button! Customizing your bed position improves quality of sleep and maximizes recovery each night. SPECIAL FEATURES INCLUDE: Fold-able Hinge System - Makes Base Compact & Easy to Move; Tool-Free Assembly; Compatible with All Mattress Types; Emergency Power Down Feature WIRELESS REMOTES: (1) wireless remote with additional “One-Touch” button positions: Flat, Anti-Snore, Zero Gravity, and TV/PC. These preset buttons can also be reprogrammed to your favorite, most therapeutic positions, to fit your lifestyle. Whether you’re recovering from injury, working from home, streaming movies, reading or eating in bed, Kyvno adjusts to your needs. MATTRESS: Premium 12 Inch, Medium Firm, Gel-Cooling Memory Foam. Our mattresses are infused with Gel-Cooling Beads and are designed to Promote Air Circulation, Eliminate Motion Transfer, and Provide Even Body Weight Distribution for ideal body support. Our mattresses are CertiPUR-US Certified, therefore tested/certified to be made without harmful materials, heavy metals or ozone depleters. Includes: Non-Slip; Removable/Washable Mattress cover that can be machine washed and dried on gentle. 120 DAY SATISFACTION GUARANTEE – Sleep on and test out your bed up to 120 days. If it’s not a match made in heaven, contact us for a HASSLE FREE - FREE RETURN & PICKUP, NO RESTOCKING FEES. No need to disassemble or pack, we take care of the entire return. 10 YEAR WARRANTY: Covers Entire Bed including Mattress, Base, Wireless Remote Control, and All Electrical Components. Contact us for more details!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712i9SbP0OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kyvno","source_asin":"B07V3SX5MB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V3SX5MB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V3SX5MB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
