window.products.push({"id":987667,"name":"Daily Treasures 36 Pack Tablecloth Clips Picnic Table Clips Stainless Steel Picnic Table Cloth Holders with 2 Pack Tablecloths for Home,Party,Picnic,R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711t432ly0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【 Generous Quantity & Premium Durable Material 】- You obtain 36 pack tablecloth holders (2.9\"x0.47\"x1.8\") at one time and storage them at home for a temporary party or banquet. Table cover clips is made of stainless steel,which is rust resistant for long term usage, not afraid of water, it can be use recycle, more environment friendly than the plastic ones. 【 Extra 2 Pack Picnic Table Cover For You 】 - To better use, 2 pack (108\"x54\") tablecloths there for your family picnic, dinner or party. Although they are disposable tablecloths, but the quality is not disposable at all. Our holiday table cloth is oil-proof, stain proof, scratch and water No leaks, you can use many times as long as you take care of them. 【 Simple Installation & No Injury 】- You can almost effortlessly install or take off each of the table cloth clips in a second. Keep tablecloth tight and smooth without slipping or blowing by the wind. And the edge of table cloth cover clamps is perfect smooth which will not scratch tablecloths and finger. 【 Adjustable & Not Deformed 】- The tablecloth clamps can adjust to fit various tables, which thickness up to 1.7inches, and the thickness of table cover clamps is 0.6mm, not easy to deform, good strech and light weight. 【 Suitable For Various Uses 】- The 36 pack picnic table clips (2.9\"x0.5\"x1.8\") and 2pcs disposable tablecloth are perfect for everyday use, party, holidays, catering, cafes, special occasions, dinners, brunches, potlucks, BBQ's, buffets, baby showers, indoor and outdoor use, weddings and more, keep tablecloths not slip off the tables even in winds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711t432ly0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Daily Treasures","source_asin":"B07TD8SLGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TD8SLGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TD8SLGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":987668,"name":"DIY Styrofoam No Sewing Avalon Cornice Extension Kits 12 Inch Drop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21Z53b7vIlL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Avalon 12” Drop Extension Kits are used to extend the 49 ½” Starter Kit to the desired length. The 1-piece Extension Kit does not need a bracket, but the 2-piece Extension Kit includes 1 bracket, which should be the same size as ordered with the Starter Kit. To determine the length of the Avalon Cornice, measure the inside of your opening and add 1-4\" on each side - this is called the overlap.  If your opening has molding around it, measure the outside of the molding on the left side of your opening to the outside of the molding on the right side of the opening and add 1\".  But, if you have a curtain rod or vertical blind rail that your cornice will be covering, measure the length of the rail and add 1\".  Pick the longest measurement from above that applies to your opening, and this will be the cornice length, and does not include the thickness of the End Caps.  The outside length of your Avalon Cornice is the inside measurement PLUS the thickness of the 2 end caps. To determine what extension pieces to order, subtract 49½” from the cornice length which leaves you with the measurement to be made up of extensions. Now take that length and divide by 33” (the length of a 2-piece Extension Kit). The number to the left of the decimal point is the number of 2-piece Extension Kits to order. If the number on the right side is 5 or less, you’ll need to order a 1-piece Extension Kit. If the number on the right side is greater than 5, you’ll need to order 1 more 2-piece extension Kit. Example 1: Cornice length (without End Caps) is 87½”. 87½” - 49½” = 38” 38” / 33” = 1.151 Order 1 2-piece Extension Kit and 1 1-piece Extension Kit Example 2: Cornice length (without End Caps) is 104”. 104 - 49.5” = 54.5” 54.5” / 33“ = 1.65 Order 2 2-Piece Extension Kits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21Z53b7vIlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIY Cornice Kits","source_asin":"B0847TXX5B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0847TXX5B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0847TXX5B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
