window.products.push({"id":987697,"name":"BAMBONI Bamboo Cooking Utensils - Bamboo Kitchen Utensils Wood Spoons For Cooking Bamboo Spoons For Cooking Wooden Spoon Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xOyWuaO6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pure Tasty Food: You need to get rid of all wooden cooking spoons painted or coated and yet claim to be natural. Bamboni 6 Pieces Bamboo cutlery set is wax-free, unpainted, and uncoated to preserve your food from unpleasant odors, BPA, and other toxic substances Durable to Last Longer: No matter how much food quantity you have in your pot, our wooden cooking utensil set will never break your confidence. Stir your favorite meal with these non-stick, heat resistant, easy to clean bamboo kitchen utensils Eco-Friendly Practical Design: Go for the reusable bamboo cooking utensils set, beneficial for you and our planet. Multiple uses addressed in a single purchase with Curved Spatula, Slotted Spoon, Solid Spatula, Spoon Fork, Solid Spoon, and a Bamboo Holder Organic & Lightweight: Our bamboo spoons for cooking are super lightweight to carry anywhere, anytime. So now take natural bamboo spatula on trips, camping, or traveling and cook delicious food with safety Ideal to Gift Loved Ones: Quality Wooden Spatula set 145 is a classy gift for those who love to showcase their art in the kitchen to cook and serve delicious food. You can contact our customer support in case of any queries","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xOyWuaO6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAMBONI","source_asin":"B096PMZVX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096PMZVX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096PMZVX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":987698,"name":"Lovely Hawaiian Orchid Ornament Collectible Hand-Painted Glass with Gift Box LO/U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TH2NUr9OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HANDPAINTED FROM THE INSIDE The art of inside painting requires a high degree of skill from the artist. Artists train for years to master the technique. It can take 2 days or more to finish one of our intricate designs because they are full of detail and artistry. The result of inside painting is spectacular: the glass on the outside of the ball reflects the light beautifully. When hanging among the lights of a Christmas tree, the ornament simply sparkles. (Ornaments that are hand painted on the outside of the glass can’t reflect the light at all, because the glass is covered by paint.) A COLLECTIBLE KEEPSAKE Inside painting is an ancient art form prized by collectors. The more detailed and artistic the imagery painted, the higher skilled and trained its artist has to be – and the more collectible and precious the ornament. Our painters train for years, and only the best qualify to paint our ornaments. 360° VIVID DETAIL – BEWARE of ornaments that are only interesting to look at from one angle. Few companies offer inside painted ornaments. Those that do, have only one way to save on their costs: create a design that has the minimum amount of details, and/or show details only on one side of the ornament. The less detail, and the less artistic a painting, the faster it is to paint and the less skilled an artist needs to be, which saves those companies in paying the painter. Patch of Shade ornaments, on the other hand, are full of detail no matter which side of the ornament faces you on the tree. CUSTOMIZABLE Commemorate a special date or year or relationship. Simply write on the glass with a marker that sticks to glass! You can re-write the text till you’re satisfied: scratch off the writing with just a little bit of elbow grease, and start over again until you’re happy with the result.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TH2NUr9OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maui by Design","source_asin":"B075QY8LMV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075QY8LMV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075QY8LMV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
