window.products.push({"id":987709,"name":"Disney Glass Tink Tumbler, 16-Ounce, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKj1vE6XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Be it at home or in \"Never Never Land\", enjoy your favorite beverage or brew with your favorite Disney friend. Crystal clear, quality glass tumbler is adorned with Disney's finest and most popular characters. These functional and decorative glasses are sure to please and delight Disney fans of all ages. Decoration is fired on for vibrant color. Multi-color decor will work in any setting and glasses are durable enough to use every day and provide years of enjoyment. Set is beautifully boxed for easy and fun gift giving. Pair boasts America's most loved fairy, \"Tink\", in her nature-like setting showing two adorable poses on these jumbo 16 oz. tumblers. Use for any beverage; milk, soda, water as well as your favorite adult pick-me-up of choice. Multi-piece set is great for sharing. Hand wash recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKj1vE6XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rsquared","source_asin":"B006GHB02I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006GHB02I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006GHB02I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":987710,"name":"Buyenlarge 0-587-00049-x-G812 Troupe De Mille Eglantine Fine Art Giclee Print, 8\" x 12\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vuj6+kggL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Henri de Toulouse-Lautrec (1864 - 1901) was a French painter, printmaker, draftsman, and illustrator. The period he created his art was known as the Belle Epoque and his focus was on the decadence in Parisian society. At the height of the cancan's popularity, dancers formed groups which offered their services as a unit. Whether the Troupe of Mlle Eglantine was the best of them we don't know, but it is certainly the only one publicized by the best Toulouse-Lautrec did it at his request of his friend Jane Avril. From left to right, we see Jane Avril. Cleopatra, Eglantine and Gazelle. As with Moulin Rouge poster, he lets the white of the petticoats, punctuated by stockinged legs, do most of the talking, but he also offhandedly gives each girl a distinct character in only a Fez limning their facial expressions. The poster was designed for the group's London appearance at the Palais Theatre. Jane Avril her friend to Henri (Lautrec) at the last minute to leave the name of the venue out of the design, hoping that it would be a success and travel to other theaters as well. Unfortunately, the Troupe was not well received and they went no further. But the cancan, which was usually performed at the time in a formation of four dancers, as shown here, continues to live in our imagination due to the lively, fresh and original composition of this poster","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vuj6+kggL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buyenlarge","source_asin":"B01B7TPUQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B7TPUQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B7TPUQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
