window.products.push({"id":987815,"name":"SISMEL Tower Desk Fan, 16\" Small USB Tower Fan, 10000mAh Battery Operated Fan, 90° Oscillating Bladeless Fan with 3 Speeds, Quiet Cooling, Timer and L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MhTJBOsEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【10000mAh Battery, USB Powered】: This rechargeable desk fan with built-in 10000mAh rechargeable batteries, Long battery life. Charging for 5 hours and it can work for 8-24 hours (Due to different wind speeds, the usable time is extra). Comes with a USB to C-type cable that is compatible with all USB ports. (Note: Adapter not included) 【Reduced Cord Clutter, Cleaner Desktop】: Since the battery tower fans don't require a constant power connection, they contribute to a cleaner and less cluttered environment. There are no cords to trip over or hide, allowing for a neater appearance and easier maintenance. 【3 speeds, Can be Timed】: The silent fan is powered by 3 adjustable speed settings and moves a decent amount of air at a reduced noise level. With the auto-off timer feature, the personal fan can be set to 1, 2, or 4 hours. You can freely adjust the cooling time to help you sink into a night of soothing sleep. 【Small Size, Space Saving】: With a smaller base and body, this 16\" X 6.5\" portable fan is built for tight spaces like nightstands and office desks. The 90° oscillating cooling fan not only provides excellent air circulation but also has the ability to direct cool air across more areas with a manual knob, which will help improve the air quality. 【Safe Design, Easy Operation】: The bladeless tower fan is designed with a narrow fence, so children and pets can play with the fan without supervision. The smart HD LED display clearly shows the ambient light, speed, timer, and oscillation. The 4-button control system is easy to operate for the elderly and kids. 【Unique Appearance, Versatility】: SISMEL desktop fan has a stylish look that easily complements almost any space. Insert the base into the fan before use to make the standing fan run more smoothly. It's light and exquisite design make it easy to transport and carry. It is ideal for use in bedrooms, kids rooms, office desks, camping tents, outdoor picnics, small patios, study rooms and any of your personal spaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MhTJBOsEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SISMEL","source_asin":"B0BW8812L4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW8812L4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW8812L4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
