window.products.push({"id":987909,"name":"Vogue Wall Mirror - Black w/ Copper Distressed Finish - Hangs Vertically or Horizontally","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bfv82RZpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The contemporary elegance of this wall mirror will bring a pleasantly distinct style to your home. This piece features a clean, simple silhouette. The metal frame is finished in black with the edges rubbed away to show the copper finish below. Copper rubbing will vary piece to piece for unique look. This simple yet sophisticated half-length mirror offers universal appeal, and hangs either direction to suit your space. Dimension include: Overall: 22\" W x 1.25\" D x 36\" H; Mirror surface: 17.25\"W x 31.25\" H. This one-of-a-kind item weighs approximately 25 pounds. Only quality materials and manufacturing will do. Product materials include: Metal, mirror. Assembly: No assembly required; ready to hang. Made in China","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bfv82RZpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEI Furniture","source_asin":"B00275EWQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00275EWQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00275EWQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":987910,"name":"Pink Birthday Queen Large Banner Sign, Happy Birthday Party Decorations Supplies For Women, Birthday Gifts for Women Outside Outdoor Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E0XrFZNCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎉SIZE: Our sign is the large banner size (9.8 x 1.6 feet). It is an excellent decoration for various homes, offices, and school environments which can catch everyone’s eyes! 🎉QUALITY: We do not provide customers with low-quality products, our large banner is reusable. It made of 100% polyester fiber, which is machine-washable and UV-resistant. It is suitable for indoor and outdoor use and can maintain bright colors in extreme weather. 🎉DECORATIVE: Let's make your house stand out with our beautiful banner, made from only the best quality material. These banners are just the right size for any space, like your wall, front porch, yard, garden, patio, lawn, deck, pool side, and lakeside! It is a very nice greeting for people who come to your house. 🎉EASY TO USE: There are 4 metal grommets at the corners of the banner and a roll of ribbon in the package; you can use them to tie the banner to your banner stakes or any suitable place. Because this sign made is made of polyester, it is light enough for you to use the clear tape sticking it to anywhere you want. 📢PLEASE NOTE: THE ORDER ONLY INCLUDES BANNER. Package comes with no poles, stakes and tape. This item is fold shipped in a flat plastic bag that makes it have creases. Iron the reverse side or stretch it tight while applying can make it looks better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E0XrFZNCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meltelof","source_asin":"B09DPS5Y3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DPS5Y3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DPS5Y3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":987911,"name":"LLADRÓ 2021 Christmas Ball. Blue. Porcelain Christmas Ball.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BjB7n2NML._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"HANDMADE IN SPAIN: The highest-quality pieces handcrafted in Valencia, in the only LLADRÓ factory in the world. A team of expert artists and designers keep alive ancestral trades and techniques to turn porcelain into dreams. Sculptors, ornamenters, technicians, painters are all involved in the craftsmanship process... An endless number of hands that, one by one, leave their mark, an almost imperceptible imprint, making each artwork UNIQUE and EXCLUSIVE. BEAUTY AND SUSTAINABILITY: Our goal is always to create beauty from a place of sustainability and respect, principles that are part of the brand’s DNA. Lladró respects all the resources involved in the process of creating, making and selling our porcelain artworks, to offer a BEAUTIFUL, SUSTAINABLE and DURABLE product. QUALITY AND EXCELLENCE: The pursuit of perfection is not only part of the process of designing and creating the pieces, but also extends to quality control, where the finished SCULPTURE undergoes various tests to certify that it meets Lladró’s high self-imposed standards. Excellence is also applied to the packaging, which is customised to the particularities of each piece, so that it reaches its final destination safely and in PERFECT condition. A GIFT THAT WILL LAST A LIFETIME: The finest details come in the form of porcelain. Gifting a LLADRÓ artwork is synonymous with celebration and joy. It’s a way of saying: I love you, I am happy for your success or welcome. We have the perfect piece for every SPECIAL OCCASION, thanks to a wide range of artistic creations that your loved ones will value and treasure forever. LLADRÓ: Founded in 1953, Lladró is the result of three brothers’ passion for PORCELAIN; Juan, José and Vicente Lladró. Over the years, the expressive possibilities of porcelain have been pushed to the limit, reaching its own unique and distinctive style, which has given the company international fame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BjB7n2NML._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lladro","source_asin":"B08SJ25GXX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-987911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJ25GXX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJ25GXX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
